    <comment>Heads the notice shown while the client is asking its deployment again after an attempt that did not arrive.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Workspace.InfoBar.Reaching.Message" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Your deployment did not answer. The client is trying again on its own, so there is nothing to restart.</value>
    <comment>Says the client is working rather than frozen, and says the person need do nothing, which is the whole reason the notice exists.</comment>
  </data>
